### lhtml-site/

The same slide, made with lhtml-site: a presentation of a single slide, which builds as it is from the zip
([open it]({{ code }}lhtml-site/html/index.html)). In this folder, `lhtml-site` builds it into `.site/html/`, and
`lhtml-site --serve` shows it on `http://127.0.0.1:8000/`. In the slide, `(.live)` and `(.still)` give a
class to the frame and to the image: the frame is shown on screen, the image in a PDF (see `talk.css`).

```
lhtml-site/
  configure.yaml                       the build, and how to fill src/_demo/ from a clone of the repository
  src/01_drag-points/index.html.j2     the slide
  src/_style/talk.css                  the buttons of the slide, and the image of the demo in a PDF
  src/_demo/                           the demo: the web build, its poster, slide-controls.js (in the zip)
